{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, שְׁרָא","hw":"שְׁרָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁרָא</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br> <strong>1.</strong>  <strong> loosen </strong> <strong>2.</strong>  <strong> abide (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁרָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁרָה\", dir=\"rtl\">I. שׁרה</a><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְמִשְׁרֵא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">Dn 5:16</a>; read <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשׁ׳</span> also v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">12</a>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשָׁ׳</span> (K<sup>§ 40 n.</sup> M <sup>87*</sup> al.);—Pt. pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁרֵא</span> (K<sup>§ 47, Beisp. f)</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:22\" href=\"/Daniel.2.22\">2:22</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁרַיִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">3:25</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>loosen:</em> lit. pt. pass. <em>loosed</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:25\" href=\"/Daniel.3.25\">Dn 3:25</a> (opp. bound); fig. <em>loosen</em> knots, i.e. solve difficulties, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">5:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:16\" href=\"/Daniel.5.16\">16</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>abide</em> (from <em>loosening</em> girths, loads, at encampment; cf. 𝔗 NH [also on pt. pass.]), fig. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:22\" href=\"/Daniel.2.22\">2:22</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> pers.).<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁרִיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">Ezr 5:2</a> <em>begin</em> (v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָלַל³\" href=\"/BDB,_חָלַל³\", dir=\"rtl\">III.</a> [<a data-ref=\"BDB, חָלַל³\" href=\"/BDB,_חָלַל³\", dir=\"rtl\">חָלַל</a> <strong>Hiph. 2</strong>), sq. inf.<br><strong>Hithpa.</strong>  <em>Pt.</em> mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁתָּרַ֫יִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:6\" href=\"/Daniel.5.6\">Dn 5:6</a> joints <em>were loosened</em> (in fear).","next":"BDB Aramaic, שׁרק","prev":"BDB Aramaic, שָׁק²"}